#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:3
#: 9e6dc036a2b0428e8af541ebfa530843
msgid "扩胞（Super Cell）"
msgstr "Super Cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:5
#: 1ad2096d53194c6a96a5be9416e74ae8
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:7
#: 2ef81e86510f42efa13a9e771f12a03a
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:9
#: 6d3d1dd1d9184fcc9c3dc7d4a0aebe30
msgid "这张卡沿晶格矢量 $\\mathbf a$、$\\mathbf b$、$\\mathbf c$ 整数次复制完整输入晶胞。输出保留输入结构的局部几何，只扩大周期重复范围。"
msgstr ""
"This card replicates the complete input cell an integer number of times along lattice"
" vectors $\\mathbf a$, $\\mathbf b$, and $\\mathbf c$. The output preserves the local"
" geometry of the input structure and only extends its periodic repeat range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 9108a35429034f9a9a1ef3d888fb4b31
msgid "你的目标"
msgstr "Goal"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:95
#: 7d66db94898d46908358f48887f34f1c
msgid "扩胞依据"
msgstr "Expansion basis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: a323de899ebb481b8ab7ca4f33a26b40
msgid "关键设置"
msgstr "Key settings"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 7fc8b22e86844c8b8763c949ffa54fed
msgid "已知要生成 4×4×4、6×6×1 等尺寸"
msgstr "The required size is already known, such as 4×4×4 or 6×6×1"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: c0e7460a983742639365d7abaafba73e
msgid "**指定重复倍率**"
msgstr "**Specify repeat factors**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: c03375110b2b43129169b9b521bd8ef2
msgid "直接填写 a、b、c 三个整数"
msgstr "Enter three integers for a, b, and c"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 2657508e3b534bad86cdecda11accb1d
msgid "希望输出晶格矢量达到某个长度"
msgstr "The output lattice vectors should reach specified lengths"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 28328762d3b64c28a2fd9711efd97fd4
msgid "**指定目标长度**"
msgstr "**Specify target lengths**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 4126946656374d44922c4c56a8d5c2d8
msgid "一般选“至少达到”；希望整数扩胞不越过目标时选“不超过”"
msgstr ""
"Normally choose `At least`. Choose `At most` when the integer expansion must not "
"exceed the target."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: a08475ad4e1e4448b8bc041c95714907
msgid "只知道最多能计算多少原子"
msgstr "Only the maximum affordable atom count is known"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 635f6d06fa334324afe0a1ae15bc8353
msgid "**指定原子预算**"
msgstr "**Specify an atom budget**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 23ec30f3d30b4ece95285f953fcedd2a
msgid "填严格上限；程序自动选预算利用最多且形状较均衡的倍率"
msgstr ""
"Enter a strict upper limit. The program chooses repeat factors that use the budget as"
" fully as possible while keeping the shape reasonably balanced."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:17
#: d20c9728eec0420eb3a34bf97cfc028d
msgid "通常保持“单个超胞”。“枚举尺寸”会真实生成多组结构，只适合尺寸收敛或多尺度采样。对于 slab，应锁定含真空的晶格矢量并把固定倍率设为 1。"
msgstr ""
"Normally keep `One supercell`. `Enumerate sizes` generates multiple structures and is"
" intended only for size-convergence studies or multiscale sampling. For a slab, lock "
"the lattice vector that contains the vacuum and set its fixed repeat factor to 1."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:19
#: bbc8d237b7384d0d83850e5588b89f83
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:21
#: 24acead44833470d9618c1fa4fdb3b27
msgid "整数扩胞"
msgstr "Integer Cell Expansion"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:23
#: 3bc4a9cd76674acfb8150fb21a200bb0
msgid "设输入晶胞矩阵为 $\\mathbf C$，输入原子数为 $N$。卡片使用对角超胞矩阵："
msgstr ""
"Let $\\mathbf C$ be the input cell matrix and $N$ the number of input atoms. The card"
" uses a diagonal supercell matrix:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:25
#: ef80eff14c8c4324baf85fe1b97e53ca
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf P=\\operatorname{diag}(n_a,n_b,n_c),\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf C'=\\mathbf P\\mathbf C,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:30
#: 5890559a64584e809528fae3087bfadf
msgid ""
"\n"
"N'=Nn_an_bn_c.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:34
#: b11f336a6a0747c3a712ca6e8b30acb6
msgid "$n_a,n_b,n_c$ 都是正整数。非正交晶胞同样按整根晶格矢量复制；这里的 a、b、c 不是 Cartesian x、y、z。"
msgstr ""
"$n_a$, $n_b$, and $n_c$ are positive integers. A non-orthogonal cell is still "
"replicated along its complete lattice vectors; a, b, and c here are not Cartesian x, "
"y, and z."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:36
#: 5eb1919963e344a9b58658b1e2756a91
msgid "三种扩胞依据"
msgstr "Three Expansion Bases"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:38
#: d4f50b9de33445f18c0604341db42a88
msgid "指定重复倍率"
msgstr "Specify Repeat Factors"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:40
#: b1d28b047e174419a5ba3d9f98f4b83e
msgid ""
"单输出直接使用填写的 $(n_a,n_b,n_c)$。例如输入长度为 $(5,6,7)$ Å，倍率为 $(3,2,1)$，输出长度就是 $(15,12,7)$ "
"Å，原子数变为 6 倍。"
msgstr ""
"For a single output, the entered $(n_a,n_b,n_c)$ values are used directly. For "
"example, with input lengths $(5,6,7)$ Å and repeat factors $(3,2,1)$, the output "
"lengths are $(15,12,7)$ Å and the atom count increases by a factor of 6."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:42
#: d176b59a6ef544dfa9fb4bd54d07e7ed
msgid "指定目标长度"
msgstr "Specify Target Lengths"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:44
#: 7a056d1bc9814e708dc9fb44ddb47f50
msgid "设输入晶格矢量长度为 $L_i$，目标长度为 $T_i$："
msgstr "Let $L_i$ be the length of an input lattice vector and $T_i$ its target length:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:46
#: 2c45f58451a1428fa71360437bcc3d87
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_i=\\max\\left(1,\\left\\lceil T_i/L_i\\right\\rceil\\right)\n"
"\\quad\\text{（至少达到）},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"n_i=\\max\\left(1,\\left\\lceil T_i/L_i\\right\\rceil\\right)\n"
"\\quad\\text{(at least)},\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:51
#: d3ac9a9409fa4d72beea9edf61fc5913
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_i=\\max\\left(1,\\left\\lfloor T_i/L_i\\right\\rfloor\\right)\n"
"\\quad\\text{（不超过）}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"n_i=\\max\\left(1,\\left\\lfloor T_i/L_i\\right\\rfloor\\right)\n"
"\\quad\\text{(at most)}.\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:56
#: 491c7bd0a6a04a409c1e20ea327356df
msgid ""
"例如输入长度 $(5,6,7)$ Å、目标 $(22,20,15)$ Å：“至少达到”得到 $(5,4,3)$，“不超过”得到 "
"$(4,3,2)$。恰好整除时两者得到相同倍率。"
msgstr ""
"For example, with input lengths $(5,6,7)$ Å and targets $(22,20,15)$ Å, `At least` "
"gives $(5,4,3)$, whereas `At most` gives $(4,3,2)$. The two policies give the same "
"factors when every target is exactly divisible by its input length."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:58
#: 882e1d14b272450daeddfe07934ba4f9
msgid "这张卡不能缩胞。若输入长度已经超过“不超过”目标，倍率最低仍为 1，输出会保留原长度。"
msgstr ""
"This card cannot reduce a cell. If an input length already exceeds an `At most` "
"target, the minimum repeat factor remains 1 and the original length is retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:60
#: 67901e2849d44146ac9096e1c7cc3e7f
msgid "指定原子预算"
msgstr "Specify an Atom Budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:62
#: 5293487abf4a4fcb872141f50596dc34
msgid "原子上限 $M$ 是严格预算，可行倍率满足："
msgstr "The atom limit $M$ is a strict budget. Feasible repeat factors satisfy:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:64
#: 6200ca1a21b04dc49975c68a58417ddc
msgid ""
"\n"
"Nn_an_bn_c\\le M.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:68
#: fc9ac5db688746d1a0a3bd4afe6a8a08
msgid "单输出严格按以下顺序选择："
msgstr "A single output is selected in the following order:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:70
#: adece62da5c24bc080ce9418ff39a968
msgid "最大化输出原子数 $N'$；"
msgstr "Maximize the output atom count $N'$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:71
#: d9337d3c185d4130ac6dc9ae04c17a27
msgid "原子数并列时，最小化输出晶格矢量的最长/最短比。"
msgstr ""
"If several choices have the same atom count, minimize the ratio of the longest to the"
" shortest output lattice vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:73
#: 7192be7bc1074e8fb3c874e761b6ff52
msgid ""
"例如输入有 2 个原子、长度为 $(5,6,7)$ Å，上限为 100。程序选择 $(5,5,2)$：输出恰好 100 个原子，长度为 $(25,30,14)$ "
"Å，且比同原子数的细长方案更均衡。"
msgstr ""
"For example, consider a two-atom input with lengths $(5,6,7)$ Å and a limit of 100 "
"atoms. The program selects $(5,5,2)$, producing exactly 100 atoms and lengths "
"$(25,30,14)$ Å. This shape is more balanced than elongated alternatives with the same"
" atom count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:75
#: c76643f0760e45c58047edf2fe53bfc4
msgid "若上限小于输入原子数，或固定轴倍率已经超过预算，卡片会直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"The card reports an error if the limit is smaller than the input atom count or if "
"fixed-axis repeat factors already exceed the budget."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:77
#: 7744c7c096cd4631a6705b1420fdc1d4
msgid "单输出、枚举与固定轴"
msgstr "Single Output, Enumeration, and Fixed Axes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:79
#: e8c340044dde47749b92ab4904731bec
msgid "**单个超胞：** 每个输入只生成最终选中的一组倍率。"
msgstr ""
"**One supercell:** Generate only the final selected set of repeat factors for each "
"input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:80
#: 0cae9e71e72a4426bb33235a88ae65d5
msgid "**枚举尺寸：** 重复倍率和目标长度模式枚举从 1 到目标倍率的全部整数组合；原子预算模式枚举全部预算内组合。每个输入最多允许 1000 个输出。"
msgstr ""
"**Enumerate sizes:** In repeat-factor and target-length modes, enumerate every "
"integer combination from 1 through the target factors. In atom-budget mode, enumerate"
" every combination within the budget. Each input may produce at most 1,000 outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:81
#: 50048183808a41c3b8c245b6517922c1
msgid "**固定轴：** 被锁定轴直接使用固定倍率，不再参与当前模式的自动计算。该规则在三种依据和两种输出方式下都生效。"
msgstr ""
"**Fixed axes:** A locked axis uses its fixed repeat factor directly and no longer "
"participates in the current mode's automatic calculation. This rule applies to all "
"three expansion bases and both output modes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:83
#: 9dd6fcfa4bb94e5d9c3d5de7433f51bb
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:85
#: 3fd847afaeb4468c8bec6b0aaa87749c
msgid "生成 4×4×4 缺陷母结构"
msgstr "Create a 4×4×4 Parent Structure for Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:87
#: 5f70163a002c465fbef2a0d761d0ab0a
msgid ""
"输入是 2 原子的 bcc Fe 常规胞。选择“指定重复倍率”，填写 `[4,4,4]`，保持“单个超胞”且不锁轴。输出 1 个 128 "
"原子的结构，可继续连接空位或间隙卡片。"
msgstr ""
"The input is a conventional two-atom bcc Fe cell. Choose `Specify repeat factors`, "
"enter `[4,4,4]`, keep `One supercell`, and leave every axis unlocked. The output is "
"one 128-atom structure that can be passed to a vacancy or interstitial card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:89
#: 9f9adeefc17a401aa0064895cc30b5dd
msgid "Slab 只扩大面内尺寸"
msgstr "Expand a Slab Only In Plane"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:91
#: aca931d1522149fc80e25471208a678d
msgid ""
"输入长度为 $(5.6,5.6,25)$ Å，c 为含真空的法向。选择“指定目标长度”和“至少达到”，目标填 `[20,20,25]` Å；锁定 c，固定倍率设为 "
"1。最终倍率为 $(4,4,1)$，面内扩大而真空方向不复制。"
msgstr ""
"The input lengths are $(5.6,5.6,25)$ Å, with c normal to the slab and containing the "
"vacuum. Choose `Specify target lengths` and `At least`, enter `[20,20,25]` Å, lock c,"
" and set its fixed repeat factor to 1. The final factors are $(4,4,1)$, expanding the"
" in-plane directions without replicating the vacuum direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:93
#: c8f6d159db904f0a8356069fd35f07bd
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:97
#: cb6c199332b4459d9f76eb2034363439
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:99
#: 60c2efea56734247aa4395228b2eca25
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"scale\"`。`scale` 读取手动重复倍率，`cell` 按目标长度取整，`max_atoms` 在严格原子预算内搜索倍率。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"scale\"`. `scale` uses manually entered repeat factors, `cell` "
"rounds according to target lengths, and `max_atoms` searches for factors within a "
"strict atom budget."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:101
#: 51c405ecbcbf4b4aa438e8de9d0b28a2
msgid "输出方式（output_mode）"
msgstr "Output Mode (output_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:103
#: 620b694fa62f4e8188291609080510a9
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"single\"`。`single` 每个输入输出 1 个超胞；`enumerate` 输出全部中间或可行倍率，最多 1000 个。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"single\"`. `single` produces one supercell per input; `enumerate` "
"produces every intermediate or feasible set of repeat factors, up to 1,000 outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:105
#: a34facf2e8ea4c63b571356428c64d3e
msgid "长度约束（target_policy）"
msgstr "Length Policy (target_policy)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:107
#: ac2dc0c570ab47b6bea466e4bf6243a1
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"at_least\"`。仅 `mode=\"cell\"` 时生效；`at_least` 使用 ceil，`at_most` 使用 floor。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"at_least\"`. Used only when `mode=\"cell\"`; `at_least` uses ceil "
"and `at_most` uses floor."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:109
#: d2e368cdab9a4cffb15dd646b4d35494
msgid "重复倍数（super_scale）"
msgstr "Repeat Factors (super_scale)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:111
#: 6419e33c8ea34dd09fdd3a2b298dd83a
msgid "`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(3,3,3)`，范围 1–999。仅 `mode=\"scale\"` 时生效，依次对应晶格矢量 a、b、c。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(3,3,3)`, range 1–999. Used only when "
"`mode=\"scale\"`; the values correspond to lattice vectors a, b, and c in that order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:113
#: a34facf2e8ea4c63b571356428c64d3e
msgid "目标长度（target_cell）"
msgstr "Target Lengths (target_cell)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:115
#: 6369ff9e810d4f1ea967673c8ac7220e
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(20,20,20)` Å，范围 `0.001–9999.000` Å。仅 "
"`mode=\"cell\"` 时生效；它是整数扩胞目标，不会连续缩放晶格。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(20,20,20)` Å, range `0.001–9999.000` Å. Used "
"only when `mode=\"cell\"`; these are targets for integer cell expansion, not "
"continuous lattice scaling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:117
#: 0708fccc7d89499fa0b1757a30ce4fa8
msgid "原子数上限（max_atoms）"
msgstr "Atom Limit (max_atoms)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:119
#: 05f3c027e5004596850d48b5b2fdf5bb
msgid "`int`，默认 100，范围 1–10000。仅 `mode=\"max_atoms\"` 时生效，是输出原子数的严格上限。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 100, range 1–10000. Used only when `mode=\"max_atoms\"`; this is a "
"strict upper limit on the output atom count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:121
#: 6a1fc47dfc144e428b6f28e70d873fb1
msgid "轴向覆盖"
msgstr "Axis Overrides"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:123
#: 3ee6c719056b487285ec9e31624c5f75
msgid "固定轴（fixed_axis_flags）"
msgstr "Fixed Axes (fixed_axis_flags)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:125
#: ccc33e765254467a9a0e70fbdffe7763
msgid "`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`，默认 `(false,false,false)`。依次决定是否锁定晶格矢量 a、b、c 的重复次数。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`, default `(false,false,false)`. The values determine "
"whether repeat counts along lattice vectors a, b, and c are locked, in that order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:127
#: e0660894d6f048a98185f2bd92fbbb6d
msgid "固定倍率（fixed_axis_scale）"
msgstr "Fixed Repeat Factors (fixed_axis_scale)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:129
#: ddda3d64253f4cfa84ab2cd6e7562afd
msgid "`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(1,1,1)`，范围 1–999。只对已锁定轴生效；未锁轴的输入框会禁用。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(1,1,1)`, range 1–999. A value applies only to a "
"locked axis; inputs for unlocked axes are disabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:131
