#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:196
#: e9fed651bed149eb81ee8cf6eeb02192
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:198
#: 3d0d96899dee4d42a00c5d106696801e
msgid "**为什么目标长度与实际长度不完全相同？** 这张卡只能选择整数倍率；“至少达到”可能略高于目标，“不超过”可能略低于目标。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the actual length differ from the target?** The card can use only integer "
"repeat factors. `At least` may slightly exceed the target, while `At most` may fall "
"slightly below it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:200
#: 44c8b9457f7540269f0422eb1a95b81e
msgid "**为什么原子预算没有恰好用满？** 输出原子数必须是输入原子数与三个整数倍率的乘积；没有合适的倍率组合时，会选择预算内最接近上限的结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the atom budget not used exactly?** The output atom count must equal the "
"input atom count multiplied by three integer repeat factors. If no factor combination"
" reaches the limit exactly, the closest result within the budget is selected."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:202
#: bb3b6266a8cd47149d5de2c729d2846a
msgid "**为什么枚举被拒绝？** 预计每个输入会产生超过 1000 个结构。请缩小目标或改用“单个超胞”。"
msgstr ""
"**Why was enumeration rejected?** The estimate exceeds 1,000 structures per input. "
"Reduce the target or use `One supercell`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:204
#: 500868acbc2a40ab97c6c05b653c59ef
msgid "**二维材料应该锁哪个轴？** 锁包含真空的晶格矢量，未必永远是 c；先检查输入 cell 和 PBC。"
msgstr ""
"**Which axis should be locked for a two-dimensional material?** Lock the lattice "
"vector that contains the vacuum; it is not necessarily c. Inspect the input cell and "
"PBC first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md
#: 83fc7f3d49934fef9894148edce6ce42
msgid "旧工作流迁移"
msgstr "Migrating Old Workflows"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:208
#: 65feaf2a3ace44479adaba583f96137c
msgid "旧 `behavior_type` 的迁移规则如下："
msgstr "Old `behavior_type` values are migrated as follows:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:216
#: 49c00f17ff39442a92caea439f17d4bd
msgid "旧版原子预算算法可能生成极细长超胞或返回原胞；新版统一使用“先最大化原子数，再选择形状较均衡的超胞”。"
msgstr ""
"The old atom-budget algorithm could produce highly elongated supercells or return the"
" original cell. The current algorithm first maximizes the atom count and then selects"
" a more balanced supercell shape."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:219
#: 1f263b72d0304eb89411587fba6f9817
msgid "输出合同"
msgstr "Output Contract"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:221
#: 4804de5e1dc0485ea9e081da1cdb7877
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"真正扩胞时，`Config_type` 追加 `SC({na}x{nb}x{nc})`，例如 `SC(4x4x1)`；倍率为 `(1,1,1)` "
"时只返回副本，不追加标签。卡片没有随机过程，相同输入和参数会得到相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"When the cell is actually expanded, `Config_type` is appended with "
"`SC({na}x{nb}x{nc})`, for example `SC(4x4x1)`. With factors `(1,1,1)`, the card "
"returns a copy without appending a label. The card has no random process, so "
"identical inputs and parameters produce identical results."

#~ msgid "超胞生成（Super Cell）"
#~ msgstr "Super Cell"

#~ msgid "如果超胞太大计算不起，用 `max_atoms` 模式设置预算上限"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If larger cells exceed the labeling budget,"
#~ " use `max_atoms` to impose a hard size "
#~ "limit."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`SuperCellMode`，默认 `'scale'`。`\"scale\"` 按 `super_scale` "
#~ "里写死的倍数扩——你最清楚自己要多大时用这个。`\"cell\"` 按 `target_cell` 里的目标胞长（单位 "
#~ "Å）自动算倍数，每个方向的倍数 = floor 或 ceil（目标长度/原始长度），取决于 "
#~ "`behavior_type`——想让胞长达到特定数值（比如所有方向大于等于 20 Å）时用这个。`\"max_atoms\"` "
#~ "按原子数上限枚举所有可能的倍数组合，输出所有不超过上限的超胞——预算受限时找最大可用超胞用这个。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`SuperCellMode`, default `'scale'`. `scale` uses "
#~ "explicit `super_scale`; `cell` derives per-axis "
#~ "replication from `target_cell` in Å using "
#~ "floor or ceiling according to `behavior_type`; "
#~ "`max_atoms` searches replication combinations under "
#~ "an atom-count cap. Use explicit scale "
#~ "when the required cell is known, target "
#~ "lengths for separation constraints, and max "
#~ "atoms for a budget-limited design."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`，默认 `(false, false, "
#~ "false)`。锁定 a/b/c 方向的扩胞倍数。最适合 slab 场景：把法向（通常 c "
#~ "轴）锁住不扩，只扩面内两个方向。被锁住的轴用 `fixed_axis_scale` 里对应的倍数，不被锁住的轴正常扩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`, default `(false, false,"
#~ " false)`. Lock replication along a, b, or"
#~ " c. For a slab, lock the normal and"
#~ " expand only in plane. Locked axes use "
#~ "`fixed_axis_scale`; others follow the selected "
#~ "strategy."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(1, 1, 1)`。仅对 "
#~ "`fixed_axis_flags` 中对应位置为 true 的轴生效。通常设为 "
#~ "1（不扩胞），但如果你需要一个方向固定扩 2 倍、另一个方向自由扩，也可以设成其他值。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(1, 1, 1)`."
#~ " Replication values for axes enabled in "
#~ "`fixed_axis_flags`. Use 1 to preserve an axis"
#~ " or another fixed integer when required."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Slab 面内方向扩胞不均匀。** `fixed_axis_flags` "
#~ "只锁了法向，面内两个方向各走各的倍数。如果面内需要正方形胞，确保 target_cell 的 a/b "
#~ "目标值一致，或者用 scale 模式手动统一倍数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**A slab expands unevenly in plane.** Unlocked"
#~ " axes choose replication independently. Use equal"
#~ " a/b targets or explicit scale when a "
#~ "square in-plane cell is required."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按倍率、目标胞长或原子数上限扩胞，为缺陷/表面/磁性操作提供足够空间。三种扩胞策略三选一：固定倍率（`scale`）、目标胞长（`cell`）、原子数上限（`max_atoms`）。可锁定特定轴向不扩胞——适合"
#~ " slab 等需要维持法向层间距的场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Expand a structure by fixed replication, "
#~ "target cell lengths, or an atom-count "
#~ "limit so downstream defect, surface, and "
#~ "magnetic operations have enough space. Choose "
#~ "one strategy: `scale`, `cell`, or `max_atoms`. "
#~ "Individual axes can be locked, which is "
#~ "useful for preserving the normal direction of"
#~ " a slab."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\mathbf{T}=\\mathrm{diag}(n_a,n_b,n_c),\\quad "
#~ "\\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{C}\\mathbf{T},\\quad N'=N\\cdot n_a n_b"
#~ " n_c"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "$n_a,n_b,n_c$ 是三个方向的正整数重复数。目标胞长模式把每个 $n_i$ 取到足以达到目标 "
#~ "长度的最小整数；原子数上限模式在 $N'$ 不超过预算的前提下选择重复数。锁定轴固定对应 $n_i=1$。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "$n_a,n_b,n_c$ are positive integer repeat counts "
#~ "along the three directions. In target-cell-"
#~ "length mode, each $n_i$ is the smallest "
#~ "integer that reaches the target length; in "
#~ "max-atom mode, repeat counts are chosen "
#~ "subject to the $N'$ budget. A locked "
#~ "axis has a fixed corresponding $n_i=1$."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在小胞上训练后跑空位计算，周期镜像干扰导致空位形成能偏高 0.5 eV"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: Periodic images raise the vacancy formation energy by 0.5 eV"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 bcc Fe 上用 2x2x2 超胞（16 原子）训练了一个 NEP"
#~ " 模型。拿这个模型算单空位形成能，结果比 DFT 高了 0.5 eV。诊断发现：2x2x2 "
#~ "太小的胞里，空位和它的周期镜像之间距离只有约 5 "
#~ "Å，空位-空位镜像相互作用不可忽略，模型学到的实际上是\"带镜像相互作用的空位\"而非孤立空位。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A bcc Fe NEP is trained on 2x2x2 "
#~ "cells with 16 atoms and overestimates a "
#~ "single-vacancy formation energy by 0.5 eV. "
#~ "The vacancy is only about 5 Å from "
#~ "its periodic images, so the training "
#~ "environment represents interacting vacancy images "
#~ "rather than an isolated defect."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 缺陷计算的黄金法则是\"超胞要大到使缺陷-缺陷镜像相互作用可忽略\"。2x2x2 = 16 "
#~ "原子的胞对空位来说太小。解法是在训练集里用更大的超胞（至少 3x3x3 = 54 原子或 4x4x4"
#~ " = 128 原子）做空位计算，这样模型至少见过大胞里的空位环境。同时，下游做空位操作时也需要大胞作为母结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** Defect cells must be large "
#~ "enough that interactions between periodic defect "
#~ "images are negligible for the target accuracy."
#~ " Add vacancy labels in larger cells, for"
#~ " example 3x3x3 or 4x4x4, and use such "
#~ "cells as parents for downstream defect "
#~ "generation."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 bcc Fe 原胞（2 原子）"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A two-atom bcc Fe primitive cell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 扩到 4x4x4 超胞（128 原子），为后续空位缺陷生成提供母结构"
#~ msgstr "**Objective:** Build a 4x4x4, 128-atom parent for vacancy generation."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "mode = `scale`"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`超胞倍率`（`super_scale`） = `[4, 4, 4]`"
#~ msgstr "`Supercell scale` (`super_scale`) = `[4, 4, 4]`"

#~ msgid "**输出：** 1 个 4x4x4 超胞结构，128 原子"
#~ msgstr "**Output:** One 4x4x4 supercell with 128 atoms."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证结果合理：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify the result:**"

#~ msgid "检查原子数：原胞 2 原子 * 4 * 4 * 4 = 128，核对输出"
#~ msgstr "Check atom count: 2 × 4 × 4 × 4 = 128."

#~ msgid "检查晶格矢量：每个方向拉长 4 倍，体积增大 64 倍"
#~ msgstr "Check lattice vectors: each is four times longer and volume is 64 times larger."

#~ msgid "如果空位形成能仍偏高，继续增大到 5x5x5 = 250 原子，直到 DFT 和 NEP 的形成能收敛"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the vacancy formation energy remains size"
#~ " dependent, repeat at larger cells until "
#~ "the chosen DFT and NEP comparisons are "
#~ "converged."

#~ msgid "如果超胞太大计算不起，用 `最大原子数`（`max_atoms`）模式设置预算上限"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the supercell is too large to "
#~ "calculate, use `Maximum atom count` (`max_atoms`)"
#~ " mode to set a budget limit."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "下游要做缺陷（空位、间隙）、表面（slab）、磁性操作，需要超胞作为母结构"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Downstream vacancies, interstitials, surfaces, or "
#~ "magnetic patterns need a larger parent cell"

#~ msgid "当前训练集胞太小，周期镜像干扰不可忽略"
#~ msgstr "Periodic-image interactions are not negligible in current cells"

#~ msgid "需要扩胞以使 defect-defect 距离 > 10 Å"
#~ msgstr "A specified minimum defect-image separation is required"

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "下游任务是体相性质（弹性常数、声子），原胞/小胞就够 —— 扩胞只会白增计算量"
#~ msgstr "The task is a bulk property already converged in the primitive or small cell"

#~ msgid "计算预算严重受限，扩胞后 DFT 跑不动 —— 这种情况下维持小胞，接受周期镜像有残留误差"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The DFT budget cannot support the expanded "
#~ "cell and the remaining finite-size error "
#~ "is explicitly accepted"

#~ msgid "需要的是带应变的晶格变化而非单纯的重复复制 —— 用 `Lattice Strain` 或 `Cell Scaling`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cell deformation rather than replication is "
#~ "needed; use `Lattice Strain` or `Lattice "
#~ "Perturb`"

#~ msgid "扩胞策略"
#~ msgstr "Expansion strategy"

#~ msgid "扩胞方式（behavior_type）"
#~ msgstr "behavior_type"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 0。控制输出哪些超胞。`0` = 单输出：scale 模式输出刚好那个倍数；cell "
#~ "模式输出最大或最小倍数的超胞；max_atoms 模式输出原子数最大的那个。`1` = 枚举：从 1x1x1 "
#~ "到目标倍数，所有中间组合都输出——适合想一次生成多个不同大小的超胞。`2` = 最小满足：cell 模式用 ceil"
#~ " 取整（至少达到目标长度），max_atoms 模式同理——适合\"至少多大才够\"的场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `0`. Selects outputs. `0` "
#~ "returns one requested/selected cell; `1` enumerates"
#~ " intermediate replication combinations from 1x1x1 "
#~ "through the target; `2` uses the smallest "
#~ "replication that meets a target, including "
#~ "ceiling behavior for target lengths. Estimate "
#~ "enumeration size before using mode 1."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`SuperCellMode`，默认 `'scale'`。`\"scale\"` 按 "
#~ "`超胞倍率`（`super_scale`）里写死的倍数扩——你最清楚自己要多大时用这个。`\"cell\"` 按 "
#~ "`目标晶胞长度`（`target_cell`）里的目标胞长（单位 Å）自动算倍数，每个方向的倍数 = floor 或"
#~ " ceil（目标长度/原始长度），取决于 `扩胞方式`（`behavior_type`）——想让胞长达到特定数值（比如所有方向大于等于 "
#~ "20 Å）时用这个。`\"max_atoms\"` "
#~ "按原子数上限枚举所有可能的倍数组合，输出所有不超过上限的超胞——预算受限时找最大可用超胞用这个。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`SuperCellMode`, default `'scale'`. `\"scale\"` expands"
#~ " by the explicit factors in `Supercell "
#~ "scale` (`super_scale`) when you know the "
#~ "desired size. `\"cell\"` derives factors from "
#~ "the target lengths in `Target cell length` "
#~ "(`target_cell`) in Å; each factor is floor "
#~ "or ceil of target/original length according to"
#~ " `Expansion behavior` (`behavior_type`). Use it "
#~ "to reach specific lengths such as at "
#~ "least 20 Å in every direction. `\"max_atoms\"`"
#~ " enumerates factor combinations under the "
#~ "atom-count limit and returns supercells within"
#~ " the budget; use it to find the "
#~ "largest usable cell under a constraint."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(3, 3, 3)`。仅 scale"
#~ " 模式生效。a/b/c 方向各复制几倍，最小 1（不复制），典型值 2~4。注意 3x3x3 ="
#~ " 27 倍原子数，提前心算一下总原子数别超预算。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(3, 3, 3)`;"
#~ " scale only. Replication along a, b, and"
#~ " c, with minimum 1. Total atom count "
#~ "is multiplied by their product."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(20.0, 20.0, "
#~ "20.0)`。仅 cell 模式生效。各方向的目标胞长，单位 Å。比如原胞 a 长度 ="
#~ " 5 Å 时，target=20 会算出倍数 4（或 5，取决于 "
#~ "behavior_type 是 floor 还是 ceil）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(20.0, 20.0,"
#~ " 20.0)` Å; cell only. Target lengths by "
#~ "axis. Replication is derived from target/original"
#~ " length and the selected floor/ceiling behavior."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 100。仅 max_atoms 模式生效。超胞总原子数上限，实际输出可能包含多个不超过此上限的不同倍数超胞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `100`; max-atoms only. Upper"
#~ " bound on total atoms. Enumeration behavior "
#~ "may emit several replication combinations below "
#~ "it."

#~ msgid "轴向锁定"
#~ msgstr "Axis locking"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`，默认 `(false, false, "
#~ "false)`。锁定 a/b/c 方向的扩胞倍数。最适合 slab 场景：把法向（通常 c "
#~ "轴）锁住不扩，只扩面内两个方向。被锁住的轴用 `固定轴倍率`（`fixed_axis_scale`）里对应的倍数，不被锁住的轴正常扩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`, default `(false, false,"
#~ " false)`. Lock expansion along a/b/c. This "
#~ "is useful for slabs: lock the normal "
#~ "(usually c) and expand only the two "
#~ "in-plane directions. A locked axis uses its"
#~ " corresponding factor from `Fixed-axis scale` "
#~ "(`fixed_axis_scale`); unlocked axes expand normally."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(1, 1, 1)`。仅对 "
#~ "`固定轴选择`（`fixed_axis_flags`）中对应位置为 true 的轴生效。通常设为 "
